        "text_EtgKcB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The integration between the<strong>Andatech Soberlive FRX breathalyser</strong> and<strong>Aussie Time Sheets</strong>makes managing workplace safety and attendance seamless. Staff can clock in and out for work while also completing a quick, contactless breath test—all in one step.</p>",
