          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ol><li><strong>Clocking In<br/></strong>The employee walks up to the Soberlive FRX unit and identifies themselves using facial recognition or their staff RFID card.</li><li><strong>Taking the Breath Test<br/></strong>They then provide a quick, contactless breath sample using the wall-mounted breathalyser.</li><li><strong>Automatic Data Sync<br/></strong>In under 5 seconds, the system records the employee’s identity, breath test result, and the time of the test.</li><li><strong>Integration with Aussie Time Sheets<br/></strong>All this data is automatically sent to Aussie Time Sheets, where it’s logged under the employee’s profile for real-time tracking and compliance.</li><li><strong>Clocking Out<br/></strong>At the end of the workday, the employee repeats the same process to clock out—quick, simple, and secure.</li></ol>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
